# F4 — missing: view, minimized 29 -> 4 lines (predicate: same first refusal).
# Perturbations: renaming the relation yields `missing: vw`; renaming the
# param keeps `missing: view`. The fact is the relation's SHAPE (pack param
# + if/else over a pack field), reported by name — not a name-keyed lookup.
view: pack = (pack: pack)
  if index < 0 or index > pack.count
    token.KINDEOF
  else
